#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0719 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when a BDS dataset contains none of the subject-level or record-level treatment variables defined in the IG.
#note "Only TRTA is present. It is a treatment variable defined in the IG (ADaMIG 1.1/1.2/1.3 Table 3.3.2.1 (record-level treatment variables for BDS)), so the CR719 requirement is met -> no violation. No member of the sixteen indexed families is present, so the rule executes; it would report this dataset if the Check did not test TRTA."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col TRTA type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | X
---
